WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.357
Unit twenty. Storms and Lightning!

2
00:00:04.308 --> 00:00:07.792
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:11.136
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.186 --> 00:00:14.980
Today we learn about Storms and Lightning. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.873 --> 00:00:19.340
Storm. Say it with me. Storm!

6
00:00:22.844 --> 00:00:26.194
Lightning. Say it with me. Lightning!

7
00:00:29.712 --> 00:00:33.245
Thunder. Say it with me. Thunder!

8
00:00:36.735 --> 00:00:40.452
Indoors. Say it with me. Indoors!

9
00:00:43.961 --> 00:00:47.078
Tree. Say it with me. Tree!

10
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.950
Flood. Say it with me. Flood!

11
00:00:57.439 --> 00:01:00.689
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

12
00:01:04.201 --> 00:01:07.634
Wait. Say it with me. Wait!

13
00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:20.258
During a storm with thunder and lightning, I go indoors. I never stand under a tall tree. I stay away from flood water and wait until the storm passes.

14
00:01:20.308 --> 00:01:21.539
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.858 --> 00:01:28.087
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.136 --> 00:01:29.287
Thunder!

17
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:35.334
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.384 --> 00:01:36.534
Safe!

19
00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:42.938
Did you know? If you can hear thunder, you are close enough to be in danger from lightning!

20
00:01:42.988 --> 00:01:44.830
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.676 --> 00:01:53.698
Think and answer. Where is the safest place to be in a thunderstorm?

22
00:01:53.748 --> 00:01:54.898
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.011 --> 00:02:00.780
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:03.384
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

